      "uid": "zhcn:258eabfccc41d744d5db1082",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现场充斥着盛大的声援声，\n以及目白家选手不辜负支持的自信表现……\n让人领会到背负期望之人该有的风范。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee86f8b682dea23b6e023d5f1ba6e4a7054cc1945079562c92da2326cc32a11e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
