    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26d6980ce43d5fdd23824774",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”",
      "source_fingerprint": "101cc4def136e30caab16a6defb11aa853330456a2c892d80674b2abfcdee00e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031440.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:642d56d54cd52208e44ad2db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场比赛\n我想选一场最能让艾尼斯风神开心的赛事。\n下一场要跑的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0293f1162b283fe020ca4c32846aa380cebe283abba746e4834062b313fc7217",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031440.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2564070d9fd4218765350d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们决定把目标定为\n集结了世界各地赛马娘的“日本杯”。\n接下来就和艾尼斯风神一起好好做准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f453f5bca5ee7f6f57cd02aa2d876050085efe6b610f93a980f024f3bdf2c63b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031440.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56728ee355d4687ecf37e09c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标竞赛决定是有马纪念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce77bddae3da6e7573f3eee60062b4eae072c83f197beff174aba5eccb3a4cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031440.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f18d6c9ece1fe2cc59dc982b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到众多粉丝瞩目的“有马纪念”\n正是最适合的目标。\n接下来就和艾尼斯风神一起好好做准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0ff0bc14e962fa8254ebe721dc9c60749f3b3c94d3948e49adf28859b6f3fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031440.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3ae56818b811a0477f4ee3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・随心所欲",
      "source_fingerprint": "936f52742d923b0cd88c8328055e0426c965258e37d61c142b0d86d90d678748",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
