    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ab7b75c647917d5e426ef4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": " 天皇赏（秋）结束后・梦想交叠的模样",
      "source_fingerprint": "c720d04fa903f71e1f5f39d5ed2ce587b15b1edda65adeac99ac317cd148c2e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a859742f518ac71e1c3ef88f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比谁都更热爱跑步的艾尼斯风神\n成功压制了外国选手。\n漂亮地在“日本杯”拿下了第一名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a67fe440aa3fa73968c1ba2d10abeb8c9834658a4ccdd52d6832f839a81f01bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031442.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7840caa4ad2131f5e6b3fb83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛场上充斥着“艾尼呼声”。\n艾尼斯风神也真挚地回应着大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9ccb37feb7ae29d9f8cde724d8c79409dab87ffc565927dfdf2f08ce5dfbe7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
